  "description": "Opt-in LLM tool calling for HartsyInference: incremental tool-call parsers per model format (Hermes/Qwen, Llama-3, Gemma, Mistral), the ITextStreamFilter that plugs them into the engine, a tool registry with delegate-derived JSON schemas, and the run-dispatch-rerun agent loop. The engine itself carries no format knowledge; install this package to parse calls.",
